WEBVTT

00:05:58.229 --> 00:06:00.564
They also gave,
I think a couple of years ago,

00:06:00.564 --> 00:06:07.238
74,000 units of air conditioning
for low-income seniors.

00:06:08.072 --> 00:06:09.532
Sydney does this great thing,

00:06:09.573 --> 00:06:13.035
which is that they divert energy
from the industrial sector

00:06:13.077 --> 00:06:18.374
to residential districts
to avoid blackouts

00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:19.875
during heat waves.

00:06:19.917 --> 00:06:22.586
So these are some
short-term things that we can do

00:06:22.628 --> 00:06:24.130
and we've been doing.

00:06:24.505 --> 00:06:30.511
But the real task at hand
is redesigning our cities